{%- comment -%}
  Cart totals shared by drawer and cart page (reference, note and discount code: cart-extras). Params: form_id (cart
  form), context ('drawer' | 'page'), show_guest (page: 'Afrekenen kan als gast of met je account', only true when
  customer accounts are optional in Shopify), express (bool: Shopify's express checkout buttons under Afrekenen, from
  the section setting; they render only when the store has them), payment (bool: the store's payment icons right under
  Afrekenen), date_link (bool: 'Geef je leverdatum door' under a lead time, to the cart page's date field). The cart page
  puts its 'Liever een offerte' link with the reassurance list (sections/main-cart).
  Rows follow the header btw switch (html[data-vat]): Particulier = subtotal, discounts, shipping, Totaal (incl. btw,
  one line 'waarvan btw · excl. btw' under it); Zakelijk = the same rows excl. btw, Btw, Totaal incl. btw. The total is
  what the shopper pays: products + shipping (cart-shipping: the highest shipping cost in the cart, from the same theme
  settings as the product page, which must match the Shopify rates; NL only); outside NL or without a rate it says
  'Totaal zonder verzending'. The shipping figure is an estimate, so one quiet line under the total says checkout has the
  final amount; when the lines ship on different rates (cart-shipping 'mixed') the row itself says 'indicatie'. Btw is per line like Shopify (cart-vat-totals; none on a gift card or untaxed variant);
  shipping carries btw too. A cart without btw shows no btw lines. Right above the checkout button: when it arrives
  (cart-delivery); right under it the payment icons (page: payment true).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  capture cs_t
    render 'cart-vat-totals'
  endcapture
  assign cs_t = cs_t | strip | split: '|'
  assign net_incl = cs_t[0] | plus: 0
  assign net_excl = cs_t[1] | plus: 0
  assign items_incl = cs_t[2] | plus: 0
  assign items_excl = cs_t[3] | plus: 0

  capture cs_s
    render 'cart-shipping'
  endcapture
  assign cs_s = cs_s | strip | split: '|'
  assign ship = cs_s[0] | plus: 0
  assign ship_class = cs_s[1]
  assign ship_mixed = cs_s[3]

  assign cs_factor = settings.vat_rate | default: 0 | plus: 100
  assign grand_incl = net_incl
  assign grand_excl = net_excl
  if ship > 0
    assign ship_excl = ship | times: 100.0 | divided_by: cs_factor | round
    assign grand_incl = grand_incl | plus: ship
    assign grand_excl = grand_excl | plus: ship_excl
  endif
  assign vat_total = grand_incl | minus: grand_excl
  assign vat_shown = vat_total | money
  assign cs_breakdown = settings.cart_show_vat_breakdown
  assign cs_discounts = cart.cart_level_discount_applications
  assign quote_url = settings.quote_page | default: '/pages/offerte'
-%}
<div class="cart-summary cart-summary--{{ context }}">
  <dl class="cart-summary__rows">
    <div class="cart-summary__row">
      <dt>{{ 'cart.subtotal' | t }}{% if vat_total > 0 %} <span class="cart-summary__vat" data-vat-show="excl">{{ 'price.excl' | t }}</span>{% endif %}</dt>
      <dd><span data-vat-show="incl">{{ items_incl | money }}</span><span data-vat-show="excl">{{ items_excl | money }}</span></dd>
    </div>
    {%- for discount in cs_discounts -%}
      <div class="cart-summary__row cart-summary__row--discount">
        <dt>{{ 'cart.discount' | t }} · {{ discount.title }}</dt>
        <dd>
          {%- if cs_discounts.size == 1 -%}
            {%- assign cs_off_excl = items_excl | minus: net_excl -%}
            <span data-vat-show="incl">−{{ discount.total_allocated_amount | money }}</span><span data-vat-show="excl">−{{ cs_off_excl | money }}</span>
          {%- else -%}
            −{%- render 'vat-money', cents: discount.total_allocated_amount -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        </dd>
      </div>
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- if cart.requires_shipping -%}
      <div class="cart-summary__row cart-summary__row--ship">
        <dt>{% if ship < 0 %}{{ 'cart.shipping_label' | t }}{% elsif ship_mixed == 'true' %}{% if ship_class == 'pallet' %}{{ 'cart.shipping_estimate_pallet' | t }}{% else %}{{ 'cart.shipping_estimate_pakket' | t }}{% endif %}{% elsif ship_class == 'pallet' %}{{ 'cart.shipping_label_pallet' | t }}{% else %}{{ 'cart.shipping_label_pakket' | t }}{% endif %}</dt>
        <dd>
          {%- if ship < 0 -%}<span class="cart-summary__later">{{ 'cart.shipping_at_checkout_value' | t }}</span>
          {%- elsif ship == 0 -%}<span class="cart-summary__free">{{ 'cart.shipping_free_value' | t }}</span>
          {%- else -%}<span data-vat-show="incl">{{ ship | money }}</span><span data-vat-show="excl">{{ ship_excl | money }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </dd>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if cs_breakdown and vat_total > 0 -%}
      <div class="cart-summary__row" data-vat-show="excl"><dt>{{ 'cart.vat_line' | t: rate: settings.vat_rate }}</dt><dd>{{ vat_total | money }}</dd></div>
    {%- endif -%}
    <div class="cart-summary__row cart-summary__row--total">
      <dt>
        {%- if cart.requires_shipping and ship < 0 -%}{{ 'cart.grand_total_no_shipping' | t }}{%- else -%}{{ 'cart.grand_total' | t }}{%- endif -%}
        {%- if vat_total > 0 %}
          {% if context == 'drawer' and cs_breakdown -%}
            <span class="cart-summary__vat" data-vat-show="incl">{{ 'cart.vat_incl_html' | t: amount: vat_shown | downcase }}</span><span class="cart-summary__vat" data-vat-show="excl">{{ 'price.incl' | t }}</span>
          {%- else -%}
            <span class="cart-summary__vat">{{ 'price.incl' | t }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      </dt>
      <dd>{{ grand_incl | money }}</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
  {%- if context == 'page' and cs_breakdown and vat_total > 0 -%}
    {%- capture cs_excl_shown -%}{{ grand_excl | money }}{%- endcapture -%}
    <p class="cart-summary__vatline" data-vat-show="incl">{{ 'cart.vat_split' | t: rate: settings.vat_rate, vat: vat_shown, excl: cs_excl_shown }}</p>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if cart.requires_shipping and ship >= 0 -%}
    <p class="cart-summary__shipnote">{% if ship_mixed == 'true' %}{{ 'cart.shipping_note_estimate' | t }}{% else %}{{ 'cart.shipping_note_nl' | t }}{% endif %}</p>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- render 'cart-delivery', context: context, date_link: date_link -%}
  <button type="submit" name="checkout" form="{{ form_id }}" class="btn btn--buy btn--block cart-summary__checkout" data-checkout>{%- render 'icon', icon: 'lock', class: 'icon--sm' -%}{{ 'cart.checkout' | t }}</button>
  {%- if payment and shop.enabled_payment_types.size > 0 -%}
    <ul class="payment-icons cart-summary__pay" role="list" aria-label="{{ 'footer.payment' | t }}">
      {%- for type in shop.enabled_payment_types -%}<li>{{ type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'payment-icon' }}</li>{%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if express and additional_checkout_buttons -%}
    <div class="cart-summary__express">{{ content_for_additional_checkout_buttons }}</div>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if context == 'page' -%}
    {%- if show_guest -%}<p class="cart-summary__guest">{{ 'cart.guest_checkout' | t }}</p>{%- endif -%}
  {%- else -%}
    <p class="cart-summary__links">
      <a class="link" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}">{{ 'cart.view_cart' | t }}</a>
      {%- if settings.cart_quote_link -%}<a class="link" href="{{ quote_url }}?from=cart">{{ 'cart.quote_short' | t }}</a>{%- endif -%}
    </p>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
